      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The prayer-poem “For What I Bless Thee” by Miriam del Banco (1858-1931) was included in her posthumously published anthology, <tei:hi rend="italic">Poetry and Prose</tei:hi> (1932), p. 15. The poem was likely published during her lifetime, but we do not know where or when. If you know, please leave a comment, or contact us. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
